[
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28A87E",
    "en": "Why are we going back to the school?{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 36
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28A8C8",
    "en": "Kandori's in the east side of town.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 35
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28A924",
    "en": "...You better quit messing around before{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 40
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28A976",
    "en": "I lose it. Why would we leave town!?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 36
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28A9D2",
    "en": "For heaven's sake...{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 20
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AA0E",
    "en": "Why on earth are we leaving town?{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 33
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AA52",
    "en": "I thought we were going to the hospital.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 40
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AAB4",
    "en": "Hey, that's the way out of town.{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 32
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AAF6",
    "en": "Aren't we goin' to the hospital?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 32
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AB48",
    "en": "That girl will be fine. C'mon, we have{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 38
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AB96",
    "en": "to hurry!{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 9
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28ABB8",
    "en": "Hey! What're we doin' here? Don't we{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 36
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AC02",
    "en": "have stuff to do?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 17
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AC34",
    "en": "It's always been here on this side,{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 35
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AC7C",
    "en": "though.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 7
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28ACBC",
    "en": "This place was torn down so they could{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 38
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AD0A",
    "en": "put up the SEBEC building, right?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 33
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AD5C",
    "en": "If it's still here... does that mean{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 36
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28ADA6",
    "en": "we really did go back in time?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 30
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28ADF4",
    "en": "This used to be a flower garden...{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 34
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AE48",
    "en": "But ever since it became a forest,{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 34
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AE8E",
    "en": "no one's been able to go inside.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 32
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AEE2",
    "en": "I thought only you and Maki were allowed{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 40
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AF34",
    "en": "to enter here.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 14
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AF60",
    "en": "Are you going somewhere else? Well, let's{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 41
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28AFB4",
    "en": "do that after we meet up with everyone.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 39
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B014",
    "en": "We don't have a reason to come to this{SAUT}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 38
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B062",
    "en": "dump, right? Then let's go get Kandori.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 39
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B0E0",
    "en": "Haha... Yeah, I'm starting to think so.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 39
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B13E",
    "en": "C'mon, let's go!{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 16
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B170",
    "en": "Maki? What're you talking about? This is{SAUT}",
