    "en": "the hospital you were cooped up in.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 35
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B218",
    "en": "You have amnesia or somethin'?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 30
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B264",
    "en": "Weird... Wasn't this place a castle...?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": "",
    "max": 39
  },
  {
    "id": "EBOOT.BIN:BE2:OFF_28B2C2",
    "en": "Even before that, I remember it being{SAUT}",
